AHHH!!! I am sooo grateful and ecstatic to announce my verbal commitment to continue my athletic and academic career at Mississippi State University! The feeling is surreal and I thank God for all he has provided for me to become the person I am today. I also want to thank my parents, whole family, and friends for supporting me in my journey and surrounding me with love. Coach Dailey, thank you so much for the advice you have given me, your assurance along the recruiting process, and the opportunity to play at such a high level. A special thank you to Coach Taylor Dorsey, Coach Jae, Coach Morgan, Coach Brittany, Coach Lacey, and the whole Alabama Performance family for pushing and guiding me to be able to play at the next level, and meet amazing mentors that I can forever count on! Next, I want to thank Coach G for introducing me to volleyball, driving me to late night practices, and being right beside me as my love for the game has grown. I am forever thankful to my friends and teammates for always making me laugh and encouraging me to be the best version of myself! 

Lastly, I want to thank Coach Julie, Alleah, Fritz, Aaron, and Margaret for giving me this incredible opportunity! HAIL STATE 🐾🐾🤍 🤍 

